TpvAlertCoefHelp=The line takes the alert colour when its net price excl. tax is below the cost multiplied by this coefficient (e.g. 1.5). Cost = cost source cascade below. Empty = alert disabled. Independent from margin colouring: it stays active when the margin is hidden, and takes precedence over the margin colour on the lines concerned.
