TpvStatsHowVendor=Seller = seller chosen at the POS (invoice field "Seller"). A credit note without a seller counts for the seller of its source invoice.
TpvStatsHowScope=Validated customer invoices, paid or not (drafts and abandoned excluded), like the "Turnover by user" report. Net turnover = sales + credit notes (negative amounts).
TpvStatsHowBasket=Tickets = invoices excluding credit notes. Average basket = sales incl. tax / number of tickets.
TpvStatsHowMargin=Margin = turnover excl. tax - cost: purchase price recorded on the line, otherwise current product cost from the module cascade (%s). Lines without cost are excluded from the margin; the mark rate covers lines with a known cost.
TpvStatsHowCredit=A credit note or excess payment used to pay a ticket is a means of payment: it does not reduce the ticket sales, the credit note being already deducted when created.
